aner still would be a MapStruct update method (`void update(OwnerFieldsDto dto, @MappingTarget Owner owner)`) so the update path runs the same generated mapping (including the `@AfterMapping`) instead of hand-copying each field.\n\n3. **Minor: inconsistent annotation style (`OwnerMapper.java:242-243`).** `@org.mapstruct.AfterMapping` and `@org.mapstruct.MappingTarget` are written as inline fully-qualified names while the rest of the file imports its MapStruct annotations (`Mapping`, `Mapper`, `Named`). Add imports to match the file's convention."
